# Cloudflare Pages cache headers (copied into dist/ by Vite from public/).
#
# The SPA shell (index.html, served for every route) and the unhashed helpers (passkey.js,
# manifest) must REVALIDATE on each load — a cached stale index.html points at previous-build
# hashed chunks that no longer exist, which is the "Failed to fetch dynamically imported module"
# error. The hashed /assets/* files are content-addressed, so they can be cached forever.
# Later rules override earlier ones for the same header.

/*
  Cache-Control: no-cache

/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
